| mine black_stained_glass | count_in_box_at_most | Glass doesn't drop without Silk Touch → can't use inventory_has. Checking block count reduction in the wall area directly verifies mining occurred. |
| find magenta_wall_banner | position_inside_box | Must enforce spatial dependency. Banner is visible through glass from distance, so position_near_with_facing would be satisfiable without mining. position_inside_box (z≥10) requires physically crossing the glass wall barrier at z=9. |

